@startuml
title Web UI Scenario: Advance the Current Grid Without File I/O

actor Player
participant "Web UI page (holds current grid text)" as WebUI
participant "Flask HTTP Request Handler" as Handler
participant "Flask Engine Adapter" as Adapter
participant "Game Engine Text Codec" as Codec
participant "Game Engine Rules Engine" as Rules

autonumber

Player -> WebUI: request next generation
WebUI -> Handler: HTTP request with current grid text
Handler -> Adapter: compute next generation from supplied grid text
Adapter -> Codec: parse supplied grid text
Codec --> Adapter: in-memory grid
Adapter -> Rules: compute next generation
Rules --> Adapter: next-generation grid
Adapter -> Codec: format next-generation grid as text
Codec --> Adapter: next-generation grid text
Adapter --> Handler: next-generation grid text
Handler --> WebUI: HTTP response with next-generation grid text
WebUI -> WebUI: replace current grid text and display generation
WebUI --> Player: shows generation

note right of Handler
No grid file is read or written in this scenario.
end note
@enduml
